    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίσχος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stalk</i> of leaves or fruit,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.5.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Gaur.</u>
				3.3
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>husk, shell</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.94
			</span></i> (in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίσκος</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Thessaly, a kind of
				<i>spade</i> or <i>hoe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.20.8
			</span></i>.</div>
